    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: blng__FinancePeriod__c records whose end date is in the past but Status is still Open.
Why it matters: Backdated postings can drift into prior periods, breaking reporting integrity and prior-period sign-offs. Finance close becomes a moving target.
Suppress a finding: for periods awaiting a final close pass after late entries.
Disable the detector: only if your org doesn&apos;t enforce period close discipline. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
